StormDroid is an unofficial, community-developed compatibility launcher for running
the Windows version of Against the Storm on ARM64 Android devices.

Using StormDroid requires a complete copy of the game's Windows version, provided by
the user. Against the Storm and its related names and trademarks belong to
Eremite Games. StormDroid is not official and is not endorsed by Eremite Games.

